## oh-my-pi text block scanner

`src/blocks.ts` adapts the pure `scanTextForBlockRanges` and `mergeRanges` logic from [`packages/agent/src/compaction/shake.ts`](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/blob/14c97b555b206231290f46882794c8d8c3c024b1/packages/agent/src/compaction/shake.ts), pinned to commit `14c97b555b206231290f46882794c8d8c3c024b1`. The adaptation adds fence/XML kind labels and exports a single-string API; it does not include the OMP runtime, tokenizer, session types or tool protection logic.

